 "level_notes": {
  "1": "Developed by the W3C WebAssembly Community Group's WASI subgroup; the normative artefacts are WIT files and README/Overview documents in the WASI repo (preview1 used the older witx format and is no longer on main). WIT and the canonical ABI are specified by the Component Model repo.",
  "0": "Wasmtime is the reference host; wasi-libc provides the guest C library."
 },
